<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-CA TROPHY SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CA TROPHY SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results from the</p>
<p>$800,000 CA Trophy men's tournament on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Omar Camporese (Italy) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 6-4</p>
<p>3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat 8-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6) 7-5</p>
<p>Stefan Edberg (Sweden) beat 1-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-4 6-7</p>
<p>(2-7) 7-5</p>
<p>5-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Michael Stich (Germany) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-2 6-2</p>
</text>
